 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p001.s01",
     "source": "Some Women, it is said, went out to seek roots and herbs and other wild food."
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s02",
     "source": "On their way home they sat down and said, \"Let us taste the food of the field.\""
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s03",
     "source": "Now they found that the food picked by one of them was sweet, while that of the others was bitter."
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s04",
     "source": "The latter said to each other, \"Look here! this Woman's herbs are sweet.\""
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s05",
     "source": "Then they said to the owner of the sweet food, \"Throw it away and seek for other.\""
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s06",
     "source": "So she threw away the food, and went to gather more."
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s07",
     "source": "When she had collected a sufficient supply, she returned to join the other Women, but could not find them."
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s08",
     "source": "She went therefore down to the river, where Hare sat lading water, and said to him, \"Hare, give me some water that I may drink.\""
    },
    {
     "id": "p001.s09",
     "source": "But he replied, \"This is the cup out of which my uncle (Lion) and I alone may drink.\""
    }
   ],
   "id": "p001"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p002.s01",
     "source": "She asked again: \"Hare, draw water for me that I may drink.\""
    },
    {
     "id": "p002.s02",
     "source": "But Hare made the same reply."
    },
    {
     "id": "p002.s03",
     "source": "Then she snatched the cup from him and drank, but he ran home to tell his uncle of the outrage which had been committed."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p002"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p003.s01",
     "source": "The Woman meanwhile replaced the cup and went away."
    },
    {
     "id": "p003.s02",
     "source": "After she had departed Lion came down, and, seeing her in the distance, pursued her on the road."
    },
    {
     "id": "p003.s03",
     "source": "When she turned round and saw him coming, she sang in the following manner:"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p003"
  },
